The original does the same work as this version, so the gain here is small. The helper functions aren't visible, so I kept the same calls and semantics and only flattened the control flow. The actual speedup depends on whether `GetNumSubFields` and `GetSubField` inline, which I can't see from this file.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 FieldBase::GetType(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    if (subFieldIndex < GetNumSubFields())
    {
        const auto subfield = GetSubField(subFieldIndex);
        if (NULL != subfield)
            return subfield->type;
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;
    }
    return GetType();
}
```

No includes needed.